---
# OpenSuperClone C formatting rules.
#
# The project uses Allman braces and two-space indentation.  Keep the column
# limit wide enough to avoid rewrapping most existing expressions, and do not
# sort includes: some translation units rely on _GNU_SOURCE being defined
# before system headers.
Language: C
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 2
ContinuationIndentWidth: 2
TabWidth: 2
UseTab: Never
BreakBeforeBraces: Allman
ColumnLimit: 150
SpaceBeforeParens: ControlStatements
PointerAlignment: Right
DerivePointerAlignment: false
SortIncludes: false
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
ReflowComments: false
BreakStringLiterals: false
MaxEmptyLinesToKeep: 2
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
IndentCaseLabels: false
IndentGotoLabels: false
AlignEscapedNewlines: Left
KeepEmptyLinesAtTheStartOfBlocks: false
...
